<div class="benchmark-examples-panel" lang="en">
  <section class="benchmark-example" aria-label="WritingBench example: pet grooming salon slogans">
    <p><b>Prompt:</b> Create advertising slogans for a pet grooming salon, including:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Main slogan (10–15 words)</li>
      <li>Sub-slogan (15–20 words)</li>
      <li>Service tagline (8–12 words)</li>
      <li>Brand promise (10–15 words)</li>
    </ul>
    <p>The slogans should reflect professional pet grooming and care services while emphasizing thoughtful care for pet owners. The slogans should be catchy, memorable, with warm and friendly wording, and a light, cheerful tone.</p>
  </section>
</div>
